\v 1 In¦356354 the third year¦356354 of¦356357 Yehudah's¦356360 King Yehoyakim's¦356357 reign¦356356, Babylon's¦356365 King Nevukadnetstsar¦356362 \add !(Nebuchadnezzar¦356362)\add* came¦356361 to Yerushalem¦356366 \add !(Jerusalem¦356366)\add* and¦356367 besieged¦356367 \add @the city\add*.\x + \xo 1:1: \xt 2Ki 24:1; 2Ch 36:5-7.\x*
