\v 8 \add ≈However\add* Daniel¦356489 \add ≈decided\add* that¦356493 he¦356496 wouldn't eat the¦356498 king's¦356498 fancy food¦356497 or drink¦356500 his¦356500 wine¦356499 \add ≈because it¦356488 wasn't all ‘kosher’\add*, so he¦356501 requested¦356501 permission from¦356502 \add @Ashpenaz¦356496\add* to \add ≈eat an alternative diet\add*.
