\v 17 \add ≈So¦356643\add* God¦356648 gave¦356646 those¦356644 four¦356645 young¦356643 men knowledge¦356649 and¦356650 insight into¦356651 all¦356651 literature, and¦356654 wisdom¦356654, and¦356655 Daniel¦356655 \add ≈was able to¦356647 interpret\add* any dreams¦356660 and visions¦356659.
