\v 18 At the¦356662 end¦356662 of¦356670 \add @the three years\add*\x + \xo 1:18 \xt 1:5\x* when the king¦356667 ordered¦356666 them to be brought¦356669 in, the¦356670 chief¦356670 official¦356671 \add Ashpenaz\add* brought them in to King¦356667 Nevukadnetstsar¦356673.
