\v 13 \add ≈When¦356949\add* the¦356949 decree¦356949 went¦356950 out¦356950 that \add all\add* the¦356951 wise¦356951 men¦356951 were to \add be rounded up to\add* be executed¦356956, Daniel¦356954 and¦356949 his¦356955 friends¦356955 \add were included\add*.
