\v 14 Aryok¦356964 was the¦356965 captain of¦356965 the king's¦356969 guards who'd been sent¦356961 to¦356964 execute¦356967 the Babylonian wise men, \add but\add* Daniel¦356960 spoke to him with \add ≈wise and¦356963 prudent\add* \add caution\add*.
