\v 15 He¦356976 asked the king's¦356982 commander Aryok, “Why \add ≈did¦356994 the king come to¦356996 that sudden decision\add*?” Aryok \add ≈explained¦356985 what¦356985 had¦356985 happened¦356985\add*,
